{"id":"bd629931e1dcac96","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction.md","title":"范数一的 c.e. btt 归约是 m 归约","display":"thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction — 范数一的 c.e. btt 归约是 m 归约","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction","aliases":["20-thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction"],"display":"thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction — 范数一的 c.e. btt 归约是 m 归约","chapter":"5","section":"5.3.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 5.3.16","source_printed_pages":[117],"source_pdf_pages":[152],"depends_on":["[[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]","[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-btt-one-ce-mreduction — 范数一的 c.e. btt 归约是 m 归约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.3.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d12aec25b5426f2f\" href=\"?note=d12aec25b5426f2f\" title=\"20-df-bounded-truth-table\">20-df-bounded-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\subsetneq A,B\\subsetneq\\omega\">\\(\\varnothing\\subsetneq A,B\\subsetneq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,1)\">\\(\\operatorname{BTT}(A,B,1)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d12aec25b5426f2f\" href=\"?note=d12aec25b5426f2f\" title=\"20-df-bounded-truth-table\">20-df-bounded-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}btt-one-ce-mreduction}\\vdash A\\le_mB.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}btt-one-ce-mreduction}\\vdash A\\le_mB.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_1\\in B\">\\(b_1\\in B\\)</span> 和一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0\\notin B\">\\(b_0\\notin B\\)</span>；非平凡性提供这两个有限常数，不要求从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的 c.e. 指标统一找出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0\">\\(b_0\\)</span>。给输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，完整真值表可以有效区分零查询、常零、常一、正向单查询和反向单查询五种情形。</p>\n<p>常零、常一分别输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0,b_1\">\\(b_0,b_1\\)</span>。正向情形 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)=\\chi_B(q(x))\">\\(\\chi_A(x)=\\chi_B(q(x))\\)</span> 就输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)\">\\(q(x)\\)</span>。反向情形 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)=1-\\chi_B(q(x))\">\\(\\chi_A(x)=1-\\chi_B(q(x))\\)</span>，交错等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)\">\\(q(x)\\)</span> 入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；二者恰一个最终发生，因为显示等式使二者互补。前者发生输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_1\">\\(b_1\\)</span>，后者发生输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0\">\\(b_0\\)</span>。这不用 oracle，且在反向输入上也总停止。零查询行已是一个可计算常值，按常零常一处理。</p>\n<p>由此得到一个普通全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，且在每种情形 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\iff h(x)\\in B\">\\(x\\in A\\iff h(x)\\in B\\)</span>，即 m 归约。证明的有效等待同时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的 c.e. 性；若删去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> c.e.，反向查询通常不能这样判定。本结论实际上容许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为空或全体，原书的非平凡假设在本条保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 117 / PDF 152。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-bounded-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bounded-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-2","targetA